'' A FIELD whose NAME is a keyword. The accepted set is a DENY list, not the five-name
'' allow list this used to be: fbc rejects only the operator words (and andalso eqv imp
'' mod not or orelse shl shr xor), the declarers (const declare dim enum redim static
'' private protected public), and AS, DELETE, NEW and REM.
''
'' win/shldisp.bi alone declares interface members called Open, NameSpace, Windows and
'' Explore, and 'NameSpace as function( ... )' opened a NAMESPACE BLOCK that swallowed
'' the next eighteen lines -- the vtable lost its fields and all 133 calls through it
'' declined.
''
'' What follows decides it: a field is 'name as T' or 'name( bounds ) as T', and a real
'' declaration never has 'as' or '(' in that position.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ast tests/parser/src/field-keyword-name.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: N_FIELD 'namespace'
'' EXPECT-OUT: N_FIELD 'open'
'' EXPECT-OUT: N_FIELD 'print'
'' EXPECT-OUT: N_FIELD 'if'
'' EXPECT-OUT: N_FIELD 'line'
'' EXPECT-NOT: N_NAMESPACE
'' GOLDEN: expected/field-keyword-name.out
